#: scenario7:scenario7_BFB2B8B6_B695_446E_AF6A_3EA9B1F732A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f60c5121a1774410a69062824f565f9e839a8831ac556d47e36e4a4c609c5d6
