msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My, she opened her eyes!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe she felt you nearby.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hehehe, do you like "
"your father more than me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Is that it, sweetheart?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まあ、⟪k:1⟫目を開いたわ！⟪k:2⟫　お父さんの気配に気づいたのかしら？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ふふふ、⟪k:5⟫私よ"
"りもお父さんが好きなの？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F8F2E1E7_3348_48D2_977D_FF8F38BC7924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c9307e419f084c009ea8277fffb5d9462d8fe8c2e17b9bb8ed20a6c739d1b99
